# Redesign Plan: 3D Aesthetic & Realistic Food Delivery

Redesign the "giriş" (landing) section to look premium, modern, and "3D" through the use of high-quality realistic imagery (3D renders) and CSS depth techniques.

## User Review Required

- [x] REDESIGN: 3D Entry and Realistic Images
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The "3D entry" will be achieved using hyper-realistic 3D-rendered images and CSS floating animations.

