### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:/projects/food-delivery-mock/index.html)
- Redesign the Hero section to use a two-column layout: Text on the left, a large floating 3D-rendered burger on the right.
- Apply subtle floating animations to the hero image for a "live" feel.
- Replace the restaurant cards' background images with new realistic assets.
- Update the "glass" utility with better blur and border settings.
- Implement a more vibrant and premium color palette.

